<subheader>Determining What Synchronization Service Is Used</subheader>

All synchronization services have behavior that can be customized by specifying properties in the <link sync_connection_string.csdoc>connection string</link>. When CSPro analyzes a connection string to determine what service to use, the default behavior is to identify the service using the resource, especially the resource's prefix. The property <colorinline JSON>"type"</colorinline> can be used to override this behavior.

<include sync_connection_string_implicit_calculation.hgi />


